    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d842-a7">

                <pb facs="0985" n="891" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg891"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7 in No. 1019.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Affidavit of Miss Mary L. Daniels.</hi></head>
                <p>I saw the soldiers allow the Kurds to enter the city. I saw the soldiers fire
                    toward our buildings from the rocks opposite, and when we fled to the hill
                    behind our houses, the soldiers fired, into the ground and not toward the
                    Kurds.</p>
                <p>I certify upon oath that the above statement made by me is true and correct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mary L. Daniels.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Sworn in my presence by Miss Mary L. Daniels at Harpoot this 17th day of
                        September, 1896.</p>
                    <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Raphael A.
                        Fontana.</hi></signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
